    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CME are delighted to bring to the market this Artisan cottage located in the heart of Naas Town Centre. Originally built in the 1800's to house the workers of the then thriving Canal Waterways, No.10 offers a quaint and remodernised 1 bedroom cottage, ideal for downsizers and first time buyers alike. Extended to provide a pitched roof kitchen and shower room, this cottage also offers a very good sized Living Room (with stove) and a large double bedroom to the front. A paved garden to the rear allows valuable outside space and No.10 is within seconds walk of both the Main Street and the Harbour which offers tranquil canal side walks. Viewing comes highly recommended and is by strict appointment with CME"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: c. 1.4m x 1.5m\r\nTiled Floor \r\n\r\nSitting Room: c. 4.05m x 4.15m\r\nCeiling raised to create large open space. Attractive slate effect fireplace with marble heart and solid fuel stove. Laminate wood floor. Hotpress. \r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining: c. 4.6m x 2.7m (Extension)\r\nRange of Walnut effect wall and floor units. Sink unit, fitted cupboard. Tiled floor. Door to rear. Door to lobby leading to …\r\n\r\nShower room: c. 2.65m x 1.1m\r\nFully tiled with wash hand basin & shower enclosure housing electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom: c. 4.5m x 3.10m\r\nElevated ceiling creates wonderful spacious feel. Dual aspect. Laminated floor.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nTo the rear there is a paved patio garden with Barna shed. (6ft)\r\nOutside tap & Light.\r\nPrivate and fully enclosed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Characteristic Artisan Cottage\r\nSituated in the heart of Naas\r\nOnly seconds from Canal side walks from Naas Harbour\r\nRoof replaced\r\nSolid Fuel Central Heating (Stove)\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nPrivate rear garden \r\nWalnut effect fitted kitchen\r\nRaised ceiling heights\r\nExcellent potential \r\nExtends to - c.51 Sqm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sandra Banim"
      }
    ],
